<string name="changelog_title">What\'s New</string>
<string name="changelog_text">Version %1$s
• Removed the "Show explanation about uninstalled languages" option from the voice selection screen: the checkbox, its accompanying text, and the related setting are all gone
• Fixed caller-name speech being fully silent after the acceleration update: the pre-warm engine binding at ring time was removed (it closed the healthy binding and opened a new one that stays silent on device), and TTS calls in the warm path now run on the main thread instead of the broadcast thread
• Silent smart engine selection: when no engine is configured for a language, an installed one is chosen automatically with no user action — with a safe silent fallback if the chosen engine fails, and the "No engine" option removed from language and caller engine lists
 </string>
